    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d906">

                <pb facs="1054" n="1042" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg1042"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.22760H/7–2843</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Assistant Secretary
                        of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Berle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-07-28">July 28, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Yugoslav Ambassador came in to see me, at his request.</p>
                <p>He mentioned to me a point he had already made to Mr. Cannon.<anchor n="87"
                        xml:id="d906-f1"/> Forty Yugoslav aviators have been in training here to
                    serve in flight units. They finish their training on August 10th. The liaison
                    officer of O.S.S.<anchor n="88" xml:id="d906-f2"/> (Mr. Kimbel) came to the
                    Ambassador with a letter from General Donovan<anchor n="89" xml:id="d906-f3"/>
                    offering commissions in the American Army to these men. The Ambassador said they
                    appreciated the compliment of being offered commissions; but that the whole
                    intent of the arrangement was that these men should serve as a Yugoslav unit,
                    though of course under the American command.</p>
                <p>I said I noted that Mr. Cannon already had the matter in hand, though I would be
                    glad to follow up.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>A[<hi rendition="#small-caps">dolf</hi>] A. B[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">erle</hi>], <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
